This repository includes small utilities that are also maintained, in parallel, in other portfolio repositories: a cassette provider, invariant checks, a JSON trace, structured logging, and the secret scanner in src/roi_model/secretscan.py.

Those utilities are kept aligned on purpose. The ROI model around them was written for this repository. Nothing in this tree is copied from employer work or from a client engagement.

See docs/PROVENANCE.md for the secret-scanner hash.
